<attribute name="problem" nodeId="e3ab4e61">&lt;p&gt;
    &lt;strong&gt;August 2018&lt;/strong&gt; - renamed Confirm Budget task to Confirm cost baseline
&lt;/p&gt;</attribute>
<attribute name="background" nodeId="3c158848">The method sponsor(s) and content steward(s) would like to thank the following individuals for their assistance in the
development of this content: &lt;br /&gt;
&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;strong&gt;Method Engineers:&lt;/strong&gt; Kevin Port&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;strong&gt;Authors:&lt;/strong&gt; Mel Barracliffe, Todd Fredrickson and Kevin Port &lt;br /&gt;
&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;strong&gt;Subject Matter Resources:&lt;/strong&gt; The project management community workgroup for the PM toolkit &lt;br /&gt;</attribute>
<attribute name="goals" nodeId="8cc6dae4">&lt;p&gt;
    &lt;strong&gt;June 2018 -&lt;/strong&gt; scaling definitions for small scale PM inputs and outputs created from PM mini base
    elements. Subject areas replace practice elements for knowledge area content.&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;
    &lt;strong&gt;February 2017&lt;/strong&gt; - added missing communication management&amp;nbsp;inputs to Task: Report Status;&amp;nbsp;added
    inputs to&amp;nbsp;HR management&amp;nbsp;Task: Acquire project team; removed optional inputs from Perform quality assurance;
    removed optional inputs from Identify risks, and Plan risk management;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;removed optional inputs from Identify
    stakeholders
&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;
    &lt;strong&gt;January 2017&lt;/strong&gt; - moved communication and&amp;nbsp;finance&amp;nbsp;management orphan inputs to contributor in
    standard PM
&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;
    &lt;strong&gt;October 2015&lt;/strong&gt; - For Scope Management added project charter related task, better positioned scoping
    content between tasks and work products including moving ODW concept to common plug-in&lt;br /&gt;
    &lt;br /&gt;
    Integrated project change control content can now be found in project Change Management practice. All formal scope
    change activity will reference that practice.&lt;br /&gt;
    &lt;br /&gt;
    &lt;u&gt;Scope Management Task updates&lt;/u&gt;&lt;br /&gt;
    &lt;br /&gt;
    Work product inputs and outputs have been rationalized and redefined.&lt;br /&gt;
    &lt;br /&gt;
    Links to Engagement Management Method in key consideration field have been mapped to related project management tasks
    and added for service quality alignment.
&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;
    &lt;strong&gt;September 2015&lt;/strong&gt; - split out support for small projects&lt;br /&gt;
    &lt;br /&gt;
    Task inputs and outputs for finance management&amp;nbsp;have been further rationalized, specifically in determining budget
    and estimate project work effort and estimate costs tasks.&lt;br /&gt;
    &lt;br /&gt;
    Links to Engagement Management Method in key consideration field have been added for service quality alignment.
&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;
    Control project team has been removed as a task.&lt;br /&gt;
    &lt;br /&gt;
    Work product inputs and outputs for risk management&amp;nbsp;have been rationalized and redefined:&lt;br /&gt;
    &lt;br /&gt;
    Respond to risks has been added as event-driven task in execute process.&lt;br /&gt;
    &lt;br /&gt;
    Act upon issues has been added as an event-driven task in execute process.&lt;br /&gt;
    &lt;br /&gt;
    &lt;u&gt;Guidance Updates to Risk Management&amp;nbsp;&lt;br /&gt;
    &lt;/u&gt;&lt;br /&gt;
    Guidelines for qualitative and quantitative risk analysis has been added. These are referenced in risk management
    tasks, identify risks, respond to risk and control risk.&lt;br /&gt;
    &lt;br /&gt;
    Calculating risk priority has updated graphics.
&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;
    &lt;u&gt;Task updates for Schedule Management&lt;/u&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;br /&gt;
    &lt;br /&gt;
    Work product inputs and outputs have been rationalized and redefined.&lt;br /&gt;
    &lt;br /&gt;
    Conduct project control meetings replaces control schedule.&lt;br /&gt;
    &lt;br /&gt;
    Develop schedule task has been re-written to specify that activity definition, duration and estimates are integrally
    performed within this task and not as stand-alone tasks as specified in PMI&apos;s PMBOK Standard.&lt;br /&gt;
    &lt;br /&gt;
    Links to Engagement Management Method in key consideration field have been mapped to related project management tasks
    and added for service quality alignment.&lt;br /&gt;
    &lt;br /&gt;
    &lt;u&gt;Guidance Updates for Schedule Management&lt;/u&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;br /&gt;
    &lt;br /&gt;
    Developing timeline guideline is new. Referenced to Develop schedule task.&lt;br /&gt;
    &lt;br /&gt;
    Scheduling considerations is new. Referenced to Develop schedule task.&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;
    &lt;strong&gt;February 2015&lt;/strong&gt; - initial release of Change Management
&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;
    &lt;strong&gt;September 2014&lt;/strong&gt; - initial release of PM small&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;/p&gt;</attribute>
